1..115
# Subtest: Testing 2..6
    1..10
    ok 1 - 2..6 is a Range
    ok 2 - 2..6.min is 2
    ok 3 - 2..6.max is 6
    ok 4 - 2..6.excludes-min is False
    ok 5 - 2..6.excludes-max is False
    ok 6 - 2..6.infinite is False
    ok 7 - 2..6.raku is 2..6
    ok 8 - 2..6.elems is 5
    ok 9 - for 2..6 runs 5 times
    ok 10 - my @ = 2..6 stores 5 elems
ok 1 - Testing 2..6
