# Subtest: Testing 1..Inf
    1..8
    ok 1 - 1..Inf is a Range
    ok 2 - 1..Inf.min is 2
    ok 3 - 1..Inf.max is 6
    ok 4 - 1..Inf.excludes-min is False
    ok 5 - 1..Inf.excludes-max is False
    ok 6 - 1..Inf.infinite is True
    ok 7 - 1..Inf.raku is 1..Inf
    # Subtest: did we throws-like X::Cannot::Lazy?
        1..3
        ok 1 - 
        ok 2 - right exception type (X::Cannot::Lazy)
        ok 3 - .action matches .elems
    ok 8 - did we throws-like X::Cannot::Lazy?
